WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Session 2. Safety on the floor.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Wear safety glasses and closed-toe shoes on the work floor.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Walk in the marked walkways. Forklifts always have the right of way.

4
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:22.000
See a spill? Stay with it and call for cleanup so no one slips.

5
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.000
That's the end of Session 2. Next: take the quiz.
